CHARACTER=A cheerful young rabbit gardener: soft medium silver-grey fur, clearly darker than the pale background, with a white muzzle, a small pink nose, and two long ears with pink inner ears that stand straight up above the head, side by side with plain background between them, both fully inside the frame; a short round white cotton tail that peeks out beside one hip. A grass-green long-sleeved shirt whose sleeves end in a soft rolled cuff at the wrist; denim-blue dungaree trousers with a bib and two shoulder straps fastened by two round brass buttons, the trouser legs tucked into orange rubber boots. Silver-grey mitten paws, each a chunky mitten with four short fat rounded fingers. Both paws are empty: no tools or props.
PIECES=Row 1: head base (the furry silver-grey rabbit head with its white muzzle and cheeks and the small pink nose, plain fur forehead and eye areas, without the ears), left ear, right ear (the long upright silver-grey rabbit ears with their pink inner ears, each painted whole, straight and upright, exactly as long as in image_1, with a rounded root at the bottom where it joins the head). Row 2: torso (the grass-green shirt with the denim-blue dungaree bib over its chest, the two shoulder straps and the two round brass buttons, continuing up into a short silver-grey fur neck and ending at the waist where the bib meets the trousers; both shoulders are rounded green shirt, and the green shirt sides are painted down to the waist; no trousers on it), hips (the whole denim-blue dungaree trousers below the bib: from the waist down to the bottom of both trouser legs where they go into the boots, painted whole as one piece with the crotch and both trouser legs, each leg ending in a rounded opening; the trouser legs belong to this piece and there are no separate leg pieces), tail (the short round white cotton tail, a soft fluffy ball). Row 3: four separate sleeve pieces, each painted upright: left upper arm, right upper arm (the upper half of the green sleeve only, from shoulder to elbow, rounded at both ends, no cuff), left forearm, right forearm (the lower half of the green sleeve only, from elbow to wrist, rounded at the top, with the soft rolled cuff at the bottom); then left paw, right paw (silver-grey mitten paws, open and relaxed, exactly as long and as big as in image_1 from the cuff to the fingertips, rounded at the wrist). Row 4: left boot, right boot (orange rubber boots, rounded at the top, the open top showing the dark inside), left boot on tiptoe, right boot on tiptoe (the same orange boots seen from the front with the toe pointing down and the sole tilted towards the viewer, as when jumping, with the open top still at the top).
HANDS=relaxed (exactly the paw of image_1, open and relaxed); open (palm facing the viewer, all four fingers spread wide, as in a wave); fist, palm side facing the viewer (the curled fingers and the thumb folded across them visible, no knuckles of the back of the hand); point, the palm facing the viewer (index finger stretched straight down, the other fingers curled onto the palm); thumbs-up (fingers curled into a fist, thumb sticking straight out sideways, away from the body); grip (fingers curled loosely forward and the thumb pressed against the side of the first finger, as when pinching something thin).
SLEEVE=grass-green shirt sleeve with its soft rolled cuff
PROPS=Left: a small white flag on a thin straight wooden stick: the stick is vertical, as long as the character's whole arm, and the plain white rectangular cloth hangs from the top third of the stick out to the right with two soft folds; nothing is drawn on the cloth. Right: a low wooden hurdle seen straight from the front: two short upright posts on small feet and one horizontal crossbar painted red and white, about as tall as the character's boots and trousers up to the knee, and about as wide as the character's hips.
POINT=point, the palm facing the viewer: index finger stretched straight down, the other three fingers curled onto the palm with their rounded tips facing us, wrist up, chunky silver-grey mitten paw like image_1.
